# Blue Moon Falls -- hidden falls basin near Cherrygrove, 20x18 (buffer 624/1300), ref Route30
# SOURCE: anime-only location, EP127 "Once in a Blue Moon". Wild Quagsire collect
#   round things and set them on the rocks of the pool under the falls on full-moon nights.
# LAYOUT (matches the still): a tall rock wall across the top, split by one narrow
#   fall (88/8a channel, 8e/8f falls x3, 90/91 foot). A wide pool below it, dotted with
#   small rocks (87/a8) = the Quagsire's "offering stones". Forest frames both sides.
#   Near shore has a boulder at each corner like the still. A brook leaves the pool SE.
# APPROACH: S path through a woodland meadow, open from the start (the anime cast
#   walked in). Attach S to Cherrygrove's north edge or Route 30. Brook runs S by Surf.
# BEATS (moon = MONDAY night, "getsuyoubi"; there is no moon phase in the engine):
#   - Monday night only: Quagsire (gfx/following/quagsire) sit on three stones.
#     Wooper on the shore any night.
#     Day: an empty pool and a Fisher who tells the legend.
#   - Quagsire on the shore asks for "something round": hand it a Poke Ball item and it
#     gives a MOON STONE once (daily flag optional). Without a ball it just watches.
#   - Wild: Wooper/Quagsire by Surf and fishing; Clefairy NOT here (Starfall has the moon).
#   - Items: hidden item on a pool stone (Surf), item in the W grass, hidden item in the SW clearing.
# TILE GAPS: no moon/sky (top-down); the stones are 87/a8 single rocks in water.
# EXITS: S (path, cols 8-9 = steps 16/17); brook S by Surf.
ref Route30
key M=71 F=72 z=68 Y=69 R=6c Q=6d a=88 b=8a c=8e d=8f j=90 K=91
key r=87 x=a8
grid:
TTTzMMMMMMabMMMMMYTT
TTTzMMMMMMcdMMMMMYTT
TTTzMMMMMMcdMMMMMYTT
TTTRFFFFFFcdFFFFFQTT
TTT(^^^^^^jK^^^^^)TT
TTT[~~~~~~~~~~~~~]TT
T(^{~~r~~~~~~x~~~}^)
T[~~~x~~~~~~~~~r~~~]
T[~~~~~~~r~~x~~~~~~]
T[~~r~~~~~~~~~~~x~~]
To,,,,,,..,,,,,o[~]T
T"",,,,,..,,,,,,[~]T
TT"",T,,..,,TT,,[~]T
TTT,TTT,..,TTTT,[~]T
TT,,,TTS..,,TTT,[~]T
TT,,,TTT..TTTT",[~]T
TTTTTTTT..TTT"",[~]T
TTTTTTTT..TTTTTT[~]T
end
exit S 16 35
exit BROOK 35 35
obj sign 15 29 FallsSign
